# PC card team-quarters (TMODE-45, BENCH-225): gate arm qg (tmtab: the picked teams' entries with QUARTERS, work/team-quarters-table.java) on the picked teams, 16 fresh seeds from 9800, against master (the aa build). Template: qtprep/qtgprep writes work/team-quarters-gqg.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml.
--team
true
--seeds
16
--seed-base
9800
--rounds
12
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
work/team-quarters-picked.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@qg.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@qg
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-quarters-@V@-gqg
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-quarters-gqg.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@aa
